'''Type 10''' was a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appeared in the [[Hometown Self-Defense Force Collaboration Event]]. It was completely replaced with [[Type 10 (Enemy)|a metal variant]] for the [[Unseen in 2019]] stage. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.4 Update|Version 2.0.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Type 10
|image = HometownType10.png
|appearance = [[Hometown Self-Defense Force Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 500円 - 1,975円
|novariants = true
}}

==Enemy==
Type 10 was a tank with fairly low standing range, damage and movement speed.

==Strategy==
A very easy enemy to defeat, shouldn't have posed much of a threat due to its low range and other low stats. Any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] could make quick work of it.

